  "title": "Change the Experience Gain Rate for Reserve Members [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "控えメンバーの経験値獲得率を変更【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "92b734e9749c2157ffa9e3cb700f0889f98d0892c934484ea66944334a8b7d87",
      "translation": "Change the Experience Gain Rate for Reserve Members [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "92b734e9749c2157ffa9e3cb700f0889f98d0892c934484ea66944334a8b7d87"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "控えメンバーの経験値獲得率を変更します。",
      "sourceHash": "0276cef9401f161f03f5c705605cfbcf26701aa0baf4a8027f77a70324a068b5",
      "translation": "Changes the experience gain rate for reserve members.",
      "contextHash": "0276cef9401f161f03f5c705605cfbcf26701aa0baf4a8027f77a70324a068b5"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "さらにレベルアップ表示の有無も変更できます。",
      "sourceHash": "f0cddbed3959d88116d7f356547d74006c03c1f80683083a874e658cf25c9990",
      "translation": "You can also change whether level-up messages are displayed.",
      "contextHash": "f0cddbed3959d88116d7f356547d74006c03c1f80683083a874e658cf25c9990"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、データベースのシステム1にある『控えメンバーも経験値を獲得』は、無視されて当プラグインの設定が優先されるようになります。",
      "sourceHash": "e98e8f373e3ceb5c64d471b85286fa29bba8b7dbad2c9f0cd84401c799b831dd",
      "translation": "The “Reserve Members Gain Experience” setting in Database > System 1 will be ignored, and this plugin’s settings will take priority.",
      "contextHash": "e98e8f373e3ceb5c64d471b85286fa29bba8b7dbad2c9f0cd84401c799b831dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のリンクを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d",
      "translation": "Right-click the link below to save it, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn this feature ON from RPG Maker’s Plugin Manager.",
      "contextHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＶ、ＭＺの両方で有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5",
      "translation": "※This plugin works with both MV and MZ.",
      "contextHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5"
    },
    {
